WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.210
Over summer vacation,
I got my motorcycle license,

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.920
and my number plate changed
from white to yellow.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:19.850
I had the engine block on my Cub
modified at Shino-<i>san</i>'s shop,

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.890
turning it from a motorbike
into a type II motorbike.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:31.740
It went from 49 cc to 52 cc,
for a 5% increase in displacement.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:36.780
Now, my speed limit, which had been
30 kph no matter what street I was on,

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.410
was now the same as
all the other vehicles.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.040
Honestly, aside from the speed,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.040
I can't tell much difference from
everything else up to now.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.050
Still, for some reason,
I felt a little bit more liberated.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.050
My Cub really is fascinating.

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.050
Super Cub

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.050
