00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.050
My Cub

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.050
My Cub really is fascinating.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:33.020
Year

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:36.030
Okay, tomorrow our school excursion
to Kamakura finally begins.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.010
{=1}Excursion to Kamakura

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:36.030
\h8:30 assemble at school
9:30 depart

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:39.660
All of the do's and don'ts are
written in your guidebook,

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.990
so be sure to read through it thoroughly.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:45.540
As I'm sure you are all aware,

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.290
while this is an excursion,
it is still a part of your studies.

